## Resurrected Remix ##

Resurrected Remix is a custom ROM for Android based on LineageOS. It adds the Remixer hub for theming and customization, along with features picked from other ROMs and adapted for RR.

Credits:

  * [LineageOS](https://github.com/LineageOS)
  * [AlphaDroid](https://github.com/alphadroid-project)
  * [AxionAOSP](https://github.com/AxionAOSP)
  * [Evolution X](https://github.com/Evolution-X)
  * [OmniROM](https://github.com/omnirom)
  * [SlimRoms](https://github.com/SlimRoms)
  * [VoltageOS](https://github.com/VoltageOS)

### Sync ###

```bash
# Initialize local repository
repo init -u https://github.com/ResurrectedRemixOS/manifest -b rr-17.0 --git-lfs

# Sync
repo sync -c -d --no-clone-bundle --no-tags
```

### Build ###

```bash
# Set up environment
$ . build/envsetup.sh

# Start the build
$ brunch <device_codename>
```

#### Build environment ####

If you need help setting up a build environment, see the [LineageOS Wiki](https://wiki.lineageos.org/).
